# Local integrity/quarantine state. This is machine-local output written by the
# price-integrity tooling, not part of the application - the sibling entries
# above cover cache/sessions/views/logs but not the framework root, so
# `git add -A` would otherwise sweep it in.
/storage/framework/*.json

# Scraped component imagery: 2,603 JPEGs totalling ~200 MB. These are downloaded
# product photos, not source. The components table already carries an image_url
# column, so the images belong on a CDN/object store with the URL in the
# database; committing them would add 200 MB of permanent history to the repo
# and slow or break every Vercel build.
/public/img/components/
